0..75 Comment "// A constructor is named by its family, `Family.Constructor`, in a pattern"
76..147 Comment "// and in a value. Where a source\'s own constructor takes the bare name"
148..227 Comment "// of one of `Theory`\'s, the qualified form is how the source names `Theory`\'s,"
228..266 Comment "// and how the printer writes it back."
